     Pakistan-only: Heavily restrict all BECCS (bioenergy with CCS) technologies.
     Sets share-weight = 0.0000001 (vs default ~1.0) for biomass CCS technologies
     in electricity, refining, and hydrogen sectors for Pakistan only.

     At 0.0000001 share-weight, BECCS technologies exist but are ~10000x disfavored
     in logit competition. Combined with 10x CCS storage costs (pak_ccs_high_cost),
     actual BECCS output is negligible but non-zero (solver can use as safety valve).

     Technologies restricted:
       Electricity: biomass (conv CCS), biomass (IGCC CCS)
       Refining:    cellulosic ethanol CCS level 1/2, FT biofuels CCS level 1/2
       Hydrogen:    biomass to H2 CCS

     Generated 2026-05-17. Updated: SW 0 -> 0.0000001 for solvability.
-->
